    "title": "Where the ferries and fishing boats meet",
    "p1": "Beni Ansar is Nador’s port town: ferry connections, commercial traffic and a working harbour atmosphere that feels different from the corniche cafés.",
    "p2": "Visit for the energy of landings and seafood, or as a practical stop if you arrive or leave by sea. It is not a polished tourist marina.",
    "p3": "Keep valuables close in busy zones and confirm ferry paperwork well before sailing days."
